### 2. Prediction Method

I calculated the square of each key, extracted the middle two digits, and applied modulo 17 to obtain the hash index.

The hash function used was:

\[
h(k)=\text{Middle two digits of }k^2\bmod 17
\]

When multiple keys produced the same hash index, they were stored in the same linked list using the separate chaining technique.

